%% Diagram: Skill Loading Mechanism
%% ID: HARNESS-D15 | Version: 0.1 | State: Target proposal; dynamic loading not implemented
flowchart LR
  task["Scoped task and acceptance"] --> catalog["Skill registry metadata"]
  catalog --> match{"Relevant trigger and scope?"}
  match -->|No| skip["Do not load unrelated skill"]
  match -->|Yes| read["Read only selected SKILL.md"]
  read --> constraints["Apply skill inputs, permissions and stop conditions"]
  constraints --> action["Perform scoped work"]
  action --> verify["Run task verification and report evidence"]
